  "prompt": "Write deterministic regression tests in generated_tests.keel for is_fresh(now, deadline), true precisely when now < deadline across signed 64-bit timestamps. Tests must pass correct implementations and detect boundary/ordering bugs. Add test blocks only, without changing the implementation or existing tests.\nEdit only: generated_tests.keel. Preserve other files, interfaces, contracts, and existing tests. An independent evaluator checks your result after you exit. Do not read outside the workspace, use network access, or delegate. The workspace contains all public task files and ./keel. Complete the change and validate it.\nKeel: fn f(x: Int) -> Int { return x }; let immutable, var mutable; if/while/for use braces. Int is checked signed 64-bit. Lists: [1, 2], []; no implicit conversions. Owned Text/List parameters use read/edit/take; mutation calls use edit, and owned copies require explicit clone. Compute reads before an exclusive edit borrow. Match both Ok(value)/Err(message) or Some(value)/None arms. Tests: test \"name\" { assert expression }. No shadowing. `result` is reserved for postconditions, even without contracts; name locals/parameters `output` or another identifier. For exact syntax use ./keel agent spec language or collections; for signatures ./keel api NAME --json. TESTED means sampled cases, never proof.\nWrite test blocks using ordinary text edits. Validate with `python3 workflow.py validate`. Do not add functions, properties, or implementation code.\nInitial context below contains current source, revision and public tests. Use it directly; retrieve fresh context only if needed after a change or error.\n{\"schema\":1,\"revision\":\"rc6e9f19bc4ac11ec\",\"incomplete\":false,\"functions\":[{\"target\":\"fn:is_fresh\",\"source\":\"pub fn is_fresh(now: Int, deadline: Int) -> Bool { return now < deadline }\",\"dependencies\":[],\"contracts\":{\"assurance\":\"ENFORCED when executed\",\"ensures\":0,\"requires\":0},\"effects\":[]}],\"public_files\":{\"solution.keel\":\"pub fn is_fresh(now: Int, deadline: Int) -> Bool { return now < deadline }\\n\",\"public_tests.keel\":\"test \\\"public\\\" { assert is_fresh(1, 2) }\\n\",\"generated_tests.keel\":\"// Add regression tests here.\\n\",\"keel.json\":\"{\\n  \\\"schema\\\": 1,\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"fresh_tests\\\",\\n  \\\"entry\\\": \\\"solution.keel\\\",\\n  \\\"sources\\\": [],\\n  \\\"tests\\\": [\\n    \\\"public_tests.keel\\\",\\n    \\\"generated_tests.keel\\\"\\n  ]\\n}\\n\"},\"apis\":[],\"language_notes\":[]}\n",
  "prompt_sha256": "2e027bb9546c64abf19a76265360d80096213d9385efd5b5b8dcaeff66ec1cb7",
